From affc3ef33bae29869c189d069f416168e0c806a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:28:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 097/203] ARM bring-up: remove the frame buffer boot markers

Drop the boot stage markers, the hex values, the exception tick bar, the
on-screen panic message and the loader output on the EFI console, which
covered Haiku's boot screen. The log on the EFI partition stays.
---
